sections.5.body:
Paidlyo suits coaches who **bill for their time**, especially to companies, and coaching practices where several coaches work with the same clients.

**A good fit if you:**

- coach leaders, managers or professionals paid for by their employer;
- bill sessions, interviews and reports by the hour;
- run a small practice with associate coaches who need to track time in one place;
- want to see packages running out before they do.

**Not a good fit if you need:**

- **online booking and scheduling.** Paidlyo has no calendar sync or booking pages;
- **card payments on invoices.** Clients pay by transfer or your agreed method, and you record it;
- **memberships or recurring billing** for group programmes;
- **a mobile app.** Paidlyo runs in a browser on a computer;
- **clinical or insurance billing,** for therapy and counselling.

For associate coaches, each person joins as a member and tracks their own sessions. The company's invoice includes everyone's hours at the rate you charge for each.

Paidlyo costs $9 per person a month, or $90 per person a year, with every feature and unlimited clients, projects and invoices. There's no free plan. The 14-day trial needs a card to start, and nothing is charged until it ends. See [project budgets](/features/project-budgets) for tracking packages, or how consultants use Paidlyo in [invoicing for consultants](/invoicing/for/consultants).
